      </div>

      <ul class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm text-black/60 sm:flex sm:flex-wrap sm:items-center sm:justify-center sm:gap-x-6">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-[#FFBD40]">⏱</span> 2 focused hours</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-[#FFBD40]">📚</span> 4 modules · 16 lessons</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-[#FFBD40]">✅</span> Lifetime access</li>
